cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use any Queen orchestration discoveries, please cite our defensive publication."
title: "Autonomous Orchestration: Queen Lotus Cycle"
abstract: "This bundle presents Trinity's Queen self-learning orchestration system, featuring the Queen Lotus Cycle (6-phase autonomous adaptation: OBSERVE-ANALYZE-PLAN-EXECUTE-EVALUATE-ADAPT), Episode Jaccard similarity for experience recall, Quality classification with 4 states (UNKNOWN, GOOD, BAD, SACRED), PolicyDelta actions for configuration scaling (scale_up, scale_down, scale_out, scale_in), Tri27Config auto-adaptation with kill_threshold, Byzantine fault detection for crash monitoring, Service recycling based on kill events, SEVO (Sacred Evolution) with phi-based hyperparameter optimization, ASHA+PBT hybrid for successive halving with population-based training, and Railway farm integration for serverless ML training. All innovations published as defensive prior art with Zenodo DOIs."
